FILE-LEVEL EXCEPTIONS

Two files contain third-party code; their in-file license headers are
authoritative:

  src/bionic.js
    MIT. Rewritten for the browser, based on
    https://github.com/u8slvn/bionic-writer (MIT).

  src/extract.js
    MPL-2.0. Ports code from
    https://github.com/immersive-translate/old-immersive-translate
    (MPL-2.0). As a modification of MPL-2.0 covered software the file
    stays MPL-2.0 (§1.4); the rest of this repository remains MIT as the
    larger work (§3.3). Source ranges are marked line-by-line with
    [OLD: …] / [NEW] tags in the file header.
